{"actor": "system", "cost_usd": 0.0, "event_type": "finalize", "latency_ms": 1.0, "payload": {"final_answer": "FINAL ANSWER: To calculate the 3-year revenue CAGR for Palantir Technologies from 2021 to 2024, we use the formula: CAGR = [(Ending Value / Beginning Value)^(1 / n)] - 1 Based on the financial data: - Revenue in 2021: $1,541 million (as reported in Palantir's 2021 financial results) - Revenue in 2024: $2,806 million (as reported in Palantir's 2024 Annual Report/10-K) - Number of years (n): 3 (from end of 2021 to end of 2024) Calculation: CAGR = [(2,806 / 1,541)^(1 / 3)] - 1 CAGR = [1.8209^(0.3333)] - 1 CAGR = 1.2209 - 1 CAGR = 0.2209 or 22.09% The 3-year revenue CAGR for Palantir Technologies from 2021 to 2024 is approximately 22.09%. { \"sources\": [ { \"url\": \"https://investors.palantir.com/files/2024%20FY%20PLTR%2010-K.pdf\", \"name\": \"Palantir 2024 Annual Report (Form 10-K)\" }, { \"url\": \"https://investors.palantir.com/financials/quarterly-results\", \"name\": \"Palantir Investor Relations Financials\" } ] }", "final_reason": "sas:single_agent", "status": "completed"}, "state_id": "run_0_finalize", "timestamp_end": 1775015476.0563095, "timestamp_start": 1775015476.0553095, "token_in": 0, "token_out": 139}
